; ZX Spectrum 128K ROM 0 (the 128 editor) labels for the Xpeccy+ debugger.
;
; Data ranges from the ROM disassemblies of Paul Farrow
; (http://www.fruitcake.plus.com/Sinclair/Spectrum128/ROMDisassembly/): "Spectrum 128
; ROM 0 Disassembly" and "Spectrum +2 ROM 0 Disassembly", released 4 February 2019,
; with Matthew Wilson, Andrew Owen, Geoff Wearmouth and Rui Tunes. Used with his
; permission (e-mail of 2026-11-13: "Sure, feel free. If it helps the debugger in
; your emulator then great!"). Not covered by the MIT license of Xpeccy+.
;
; This list: Klive IDE's names; the data ranges from his 128 ROM 0 disassembly.
;
; Names from Klive IDE's ROM annotations, file sp128-0.rom.dis
; (https://github.com/Dotneteer/kliveide, src/public/roms, commit e227b87c,
; 2026-11-06), MIT license:
;
